   "episodes_in_order": [
    "6:00 am in inn: Phil reaches the square. Rita says: Morning, Phil. The groundhog forecast is on the radio; let's get the weather segment locked in before the diner crowd wakes up. Rita spends the period at the inn. You see Larry at the square.",
    "9:30 am in square: Phil spends the period at the square. You see Rita at the square. Larry says: Let's keep the setup tight, Phil. I'm watching the stage now. Larry spends the period at the square.",
