    "7:00 pm in Pittsburgh: Phil phones his sister. She confirms the moving van is booked for Wednesday. The pre-recorded station ident runs in the unattended seven o'clock slot."
   ],
   "end_of_that_evening": "You fell asleep in Pittsburgh."
  },
